{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06344","headline":"古塞下曲 · 李颀","name":"古塞下曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行人朝走马，直指蓟城傍。\n蓟城通漠北，万里别吾乡。\n海上千烽火，沙中百战场。\n军书发上郡，春色度河阳。\n褭褭汉宫柳，青青胡地桑。\n琵琶出塞曲，横笛断君肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}